(a) The director shall approve a certificate of appropriateness for the construction of any one, but no combination of the following additions to a contributing structure in a historic district:

(1) A rear addition that:

a. Is not taller than the existing structure;

b. Is set back from the side property lines at least as much as the structural walls of the existing structure;

c. Is not wider than the wall to which it is attached;

