(a) The commission shall consider each complete application referred by the director and shall hold a public hearing on the application. After the close of the public hearing, the commission shall consider the application and recommend designation of a proposed special minimum lot size block or a special minimum lot size area that complies with the following criteria:

(1) The proposed area has an identifiable lot size character, taking into account the age of the neighborhood, existing evidence of a common plan and scheme of development, and other factors that the commission reasonably determines to be relevant to an individual application;

