(e) Termination of service is suspended by a request for an administrative hearing unless the service was terminated prior to the customer's request for the hearing, the customer closes or transfers his account to a new address, the customer fails to pay charges not in dispute or the customer has prevented the city from obtaining meter readings within the last 60 days.

